&_nc_oc=Adqk7gSEsGAdW_QljjsG60RF7-dJJPo3QpY-QZh4uDVI4mxkc7zATSNe-Sj94GT1GeM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFDIe9-BGljHgkcXpKliDGZzIxx_irgk49A7QWRexAgJQ&oe=6A819BFE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AW9Q1eodaX8Q7kNvwEVpvGy&_nc_oc=AdouZ-qFAWs69P_Rlv8wf1JyKsZ9ZeX2B1XpePCNlyXPYeWHgu3gl0zfUf8yhyqMFmI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHtVCv3UvaSLcu-6QGRTPspdsL-_5IsvzJL6Eoro6Cj6g&oe=6A81ACFC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LeMbYxxisvYQ7kNvwHGWY-b&_nc_oc=AdpryfrF3nWCwogoWxsUvMNpe5oKTiiav82FpcvlEYEtoDKgYRcPTQIbDxc8tY1dGxE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGm58QtRrjfXee3Ff69Suuyp3W-GP_3SB8EOXT0CGKOmA&oe=6A819347"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iIqT_ZZZADIQ7kNvwEgnlY_&_nc_oc=Adr7NpwP0k2okLhcmeQ-1yMbJCHXU8gBANfgDK7H846zx-lXmTUZHvzHkEe2u7JYNAw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFuYBGng9shLEcUDUsDvKxhyoA5LB9lic6MDr9xAcAzvA&oe=6A81B755"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v9YFmkSzkbIQ7kNvwF4r45d&_nc_oc=Adp0SHYiAY7bNBNFPxQgvWm-Lchvsd-n6-h24spZygdj7GJ9ykha1eEMPZgpTwwNYsg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHzcRj05n-h5CsbRxiEeeFAnAZ7NtxyRFN4vLP3SP0dcg&oe=6A81C3E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.